            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.26+JDG.16.27+JDG.16.28+JDG.16.29+JDG.16.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 16:26-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabonye Umwami Imana ahagaze i ruhande y’igicaniro, aravuga, ati Kubita imyashi y’inkingi, amatanguriro y’imiryango anyiganyige: uyibamenagurire ku mitwe yabo bose; kand’ ūzosigara muri bo wese nzomwicisha inkota: nta n’umwe muri bo azoshobora guhunga, nta n’umwe muri bo azokwikiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.139.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 139:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.139.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho bokwiyimbira bakaja i kuzimu, na ho ukuboko kwanje kwobakūrayo; naho bokwūrira bakaja mw ijuru, na ho nyene nzobamanurayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi naho bokwinyegeza ku mpinga ya Karumeli, na ho nzobarondera mbanyegurureyo; canke naho bokwihisha inyonga zanje i bgina mu kiyaga, aho na ho nzogomora inzoka ibakomorereyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 21:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi naho bokwambukanwa n’abansi babo ar’ inyagano, aho na ho nzohabagomorera inkota, ibamare: kandi nzobatungīra igitsure co kubazanira ivyago ariko s’amahirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
